          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Reads api_request_duration_seconds_bucket, published by metrics_middleware in src/dcc/api_async.py with the route template as a LABEL (route=...), in seconds. The buckets exist: the app's /metrics emits api_request_duration_seconds_bucket{le=\"0.25\",route=\"/v2/overview\"} and the le=\"+Inf\" terminator, plus _sum and _count. Grouping is by (le, route) because the histogram carries no status label. A route with no traffic in the window returns no series, not zero.",
